---
layout: layouts/base.njk
navActive: dharma
title: Dharma
description: A practice, not a hobby - Sīlavāpi on ordination into the Triratna Buddhist Order, the meaning of the name, and being a trustee of Breathworks.
---
{% from "macros/ui.njk" import sectionHeading, button, quote, articleCard %}
{%- set dharmaPosts = collections.posts | byCategories(["Buddhism"]) | limit(3) -%}

<section>
  <div class="container page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__prose">
      {{ sectionHeading("Dharma", "A practice, not a hobby", 1, "I was ordained into the Triratna Buddhist Order in 2026 after sixteen years of practice. This page gathers everything on the site about that life.") }}
      <p>
        Sīlavāpi is the name I was given at ordination. It is rooted in
        <em>sīla</em> - ethical practice - which feels right: for me the dharma
        has never been separate from work, community, or how a piece of software
        treats the people who use it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Away from the cushion I'm a trustee of <strong>Breathworks</strong>, a
        charity teaching mindfulness-based approaches to living with pain and
        illness - work that sits very close to my own experience of living with
        Ehlers-Danlos Syndrome.
      </p>
      <div class="cluster">
        {{ button("The story of my name", "/blog/introducing-silavapi/", "primary") }}
        {{ button("Buddhism on the blog", "/blog/", "secondary") }}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about__portrait">
      <img src="/assets/img/photography/portrait-04.jpg" alt="Black-and-white portrait of Sīlavāpi, gaze lifted away from the camera" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="quote-band">
  <div class="container section-y-sm">
    {{ quote("A name is not a costume. It is a direction of travel.", "Sīlavāpi", "dark") }}
  </div>
</section>

{% if dharmaPosts | length %}
  <section class="surface-subtle-band" aria-label="Dharma on the blog">
    <div class="container section-y-sm stack">
      {{ sectionHeading("Writing", "Dharma on the blog", 2) }}
      <div class="card-grid">
        {% for post in dharmaPosts %}
          {{ articleCard({
            title: post.data.title,
            excerpt: post.data.excerpt,
            image: post.data.image,
            imageAlt: post.data.imageAlt,
            date: post.date | readableDate,
            category: post.data.category,
            tone: categories.tones[post.data.category] or "neutral",
            href: post.url
          }) }}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{% endif %}
